  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Earth Africa Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to Geoscience Australia to support Digital Earth Africa which provides African countries with access to free and open information available from satellite images relating to flooding, drought, soil and coastal erosion, agriculture, forest cover, land use and land cover change, water availability and quality, and changes to human settlements. Digital Earth Africa Phase III will create additional value from the science, technology, and institutional arrangements established in Phase II, by driving uptake of the program and delivering impact in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
